# Pointer — plan-mode-first

Follow the vendored ThreeWill engineering standard:

[`docs/agent/standards/plan-mode-first.mdc`](../../docs/agent/standards/plan-mode-first.mdc)

Do **not** edit `docs/agent/standards/` by hand (sync PRs refresh it). Product-only overrides live in `docs/agent/` and root `AGENTS.md`.

